{
  "schema":"icax.assembly-template","schemaVersion":1,"id":"three-end-end-end","version":"1.0.0",
  "displayName":"三端汇交","category":"three-end-end-end","categoryName":"三件 · 端—端—端",
  "summary":"三个构件端部汇交到同一节点，可选择平面 T 形或空间三向节点。",
